fix(tests): replace diesel migration run in docker-compose

- Replaced `diesel migration run` with `cargo test --test setup_migrations` in the `db_init` service of `.compose/docker-compose.test.yml`. 
- The standard `diesel CLI` does not natively support recursively executing migrations from multiple split directories (`system/` and `tenant/`) without extra configuration, which resulted in empty test databases. Using the Rust test binary ensures `embed_migrations!` accurately populates the test database.
